      "content": "The news makes it sound like the opposition is actually gaining a lot of ground and the whole government situation is basically illegitimate. From a travel perspective, is the risk mostly coming from the government trying to crack down on protesters, or is it more about the opposition groups causing chaos in the streets? Which side should I actually be worried about if I'm just trying to get around the city?",
